# The Understand-Anything knowledge graph is a generated artifact: large JSON that
# changes wholesale on every /understand run. Mark it generated + suppress diffs so it
# doesn't drown `git diff`/blame/PR reviews. It is still committed (the shared artifact).
.understand-anything/knowledge-graph.json linguist-generated=true -diff
.understand-anything/meta.json           linguist-generated=true -diff
